<title>USA: Sunset Publishing names Glendinning N.Y. head.</title>
<headline>Sunset Publishing names Glendinning N.Y. head.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunset Publishing Corp, owned by Time Warner Inc, said Thursday that Tori Glendinning has been named its New York manager.</p>
<p>Sunset said Glendinning was recently advertising director at Working Mother magazine, owned by  MacDonald Communications Corp, a private New York company.</p>
<p>Sunset said Glendinning will run its New York ad sales office.</p>
